  "content_id": "16136223",
  "title": "Algorand ALGO Network Fees",
  "description": "Algorand (ALGO) Network – Instant and Predictable\nAlgorand is famous for fast, low-cost transactions with predictable flat fees.\nHow ALGO ...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ3WEJNRF2NDRVY26XW6FCE\">Algorand (ALGO) Network – Instant and Predictable</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Algorand is famous for fast, low-cost transactions with predictable flat fees.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ3WEJNP5NMYKCPPSQK9KBY\">How ALGO Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Flat minimum fee</b> (usually 0.001 ALGO)</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Small adjustments for very complex transactions</b></p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge automatically applies the correct fee without needing user adjustment.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ3WEJN3VWPP9NKFWCS90ZF\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>One flat fee</b> — minimal and instant confirmation.</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ3WEJNK6NZ8EKH67W84AB7\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Around <b>$0.0015 USD</b> per transaction.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ3WEJNWAQ0HYYH7GP9P9T4\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Algorand’s reliability and cheap fees make it ideal for quick payments. With Edge, you get instant transactions without worrying about fee settings.</p><hr><h1 id=\"h_01JSZ3WEJNBXWAXQAAYM2WW0F0\">Filecoin (FIL) Network Fees – Storage-Focused Transactions</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Filecoin isn’t just crypto—it’s built for decentralized storage, but regular FIL transfers are still simple.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ3WEJNESAXR5QP6HV8V9WJ\">How FIL Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Base fee</b> based on network load</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Priority fee</b> if you want faster confirmation</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees are automatically estimated by Edge.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ3WEJNN973N5CKN3Q7J1S3\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – For quicker confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Standard for everyday transfers</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Accept slower confirmation to save</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Full manual gas setting</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ3WEJN24ZWSRX1FWC8FHGW\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Typically <b>$0.05 to $0.20 USD</b> depending on network demand.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ3WEJPFC62GJ4HHCJHE0W5\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Filecoin manages real-world data, and Edge Wallet makes sending FIL fast and cost-effective with smart fee estimation.</p>",
